.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/edit-tool-refuses-symlink-paths.md:20:During Task 01 Execution, the executor attempted to edit `.claude/skills/orchestration/SKILL.md` (a symlink) using the Edit tool. The tool refused with "Refusing to write through symlink". The executor fell back to the canonical target path `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/skills/orchestration/SKILL.md` and the edit succeeded.
