# Idea — Chat Mode + Auto Mode Redesign (iter2)

> **Session:** 2026-05-28-8eed14fb-c4b5-455f-aa5e-497c33ed8bbf · **Phase:** Ideation iter2 WORK · **Leader:** orchestration redesign
